
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Yeeun's MyLink</title>
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 30px 20px;
      background: #f5f0e9;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      color: #55483e;
    }

    .profile {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 390px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .avatar {
      width: 100px;
      height: 100px;
      margin: auto;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: #e5d8c9;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 38px;
    }

    h1 { font-size: 27px; margin: 20px 0 8px; }

    .intro {
      color: #897b70;
      font-size: 14px;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }

    .link {
      display: block;
      padding: 16px;
      margin: 13px 0;
      border-radius: 14px;
      background: #fffdf9;
      color: #55483e;
      text-decoration: none;
      border: 1px solid #e9dfd5;
      transition: 0.2s;
    }

    .link:hover { background: #eadfd2; }

    footer {
      margin-top: 35px;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #a89a8e;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <main class="profile">
    <div class="avatar">♡</div>

    <h1>Hi, I'm Yeeun!</h1>

    <p class="intro">
      Welcome to my little space.<br>
      일상을 기록하는 공간입니다.
    </p>

    <a class="link"
       href="https://www.instagram.com/"
       target="_blank">Instagram ↗</a>

    <a class="link"
       href="https://github.com/yeeun0107"
       target="_blank">GitHub ↗</a>

    <a class="link"
       href="mailto:">Contact ↗</a>

    <footer>© 2026 Yeeun. All rights reserved.</footer>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
